_dictionary_audit.version
_dictionary_audit.date
_dictionary_audit.revision
0.18.0 2019-03-19 'Automatically converting to DDLm'
0.017 2019-03-19
;
2019-03-19 Defining items '_tcod_software_library_*' as looped. A.M.

2019-03-18 Adding missing type for '_tcod_citation_linkage'. A.M.

2018-02-27 Defining '_tcod_data_source_file' and '_tcod_data_source_block'
           data items. A.M.

2018-02-06 Putting '_tcod_software_library_*', 
           '_tcod_initial_coordinate_*', '_tcod_total_energy_*',
           '_tcod_atom_site_residual_force*' and
           '_tcod_initial_cell_param_db_*'data items into a separate
           category. Fixing '_name' parameters for data items
           '_tcod_software_library_binary_uri' and
           '_tcod_software_library_source_uri'. A.M.

2017-04-25 Specifying links (parent, child) between
           '_tcod_computation_input_file',
           '_tcod_computation_log_file', '_tcod_computation_stdout',
           '_tcod_computation_stderr' and '_tcod_file_id'. Adding
           descriptions for aforementioned tags. A.M.

2016-11-02 Adding category '_tcod_computation_[]', with all it's tags
           defining a loop. Making '_tcod_computation_step' mandatory,
           putting a strict definition of it's values. A.M.

2015-06-16 Adding '_tcod_database_code'. Fixing typo in enumeration value
           for tag '_tcod_file_contents_type': 'basissset' -> 'basisset'.
           Fixing typo in tag name:
           _tcod_source_structure_uuid -> _tcod_source_structure_database_uuid.
           Creating categories '_tcod_source_structure_database_[]' and
           '_tcod_ff_[]'. A.M.

2015-05-21 Creating categories '_tcod_file_[]' and '_tcod_content_encoding_[]',
           adding links (parent, child) between '_tcod_file_content_encoding'
           and '_tcod_content_encoding_id'. Marking list tags. Updating version
           number to 0.005. A.M.

2015-01-05 Adding _tcod_content_encoding_* tags, describing the content
           encoding stack in a more formal way.
           Fixing typo in tag name:
           _tcode_structure_type -> _tcod_structure_type. A.M.

2014-11-04 Moving all software related data items to this dictionary,
           consolidating all data items that should be relevant to
           more han one method. Adding data items that should be
           helpful for quality/convergence checks. S.G.

2014-07-22 Adding a description of the '_tcode_structure_type' data item. S.G.

2014-03-07 Updated version 

2013-07-22 TCOD dictionary initiated by Saulius Grazulis 

2013-08-17 First version by Linas Vilciauskas (NYU) and Saulius Grazulis 
;
