_definition.class                Datum
_type.container                  Single
_type.contents                   Text
_name.category_id                category_overview
_definition.id                   '_tcod_source_database_name'
_name.object_id                  '_tcod_source_database_name'
save_
save_tcod_source_database_URI
_description.text
; A (stable) URI (or URL) of the database Web site describing the
database that produced the structure.

Example:

_tcod_source_database_URI http://www.aiida.net/
;
