save_tcod_atom_sites_sim_cell_tran_matrix_11
_name.category_id                atom_sites
_description.text
;

              Matrix elements used to transform fractional coordinates
               in the ATOM_SITE category to fractional coordinates in
               the simulation cell. The 3 x 1 translation
               is defined in _atom_sites_sim_cell_tran_vector_*.

                 x'   fractional      |11 12 13|      x   fractional     | 1 |
               ( y' ) simulation   =  |21 22 23|    ( y ) conventional + | 2 |
                 z'   cell coords     |31 32 33|      z   cell coords    | 3 |
;
_definition.update               2019-03-19
_definition.class                Datum
_type.container                  Single
_type.contents                   Real
_definition.id                   '_tcod_atom_sites_sim_cell_tran_matrix_11'
_name.object_id                  '_tcod_atom_sites_sim_cell_tran_matrix_11'
